!!! A record declared in one book, extended from another.
!!!
!!! This is the shape a project uses when it keeps one type to a file: the
!!! record lives in its own book and the operations on it live beside it in
!!! another. It compiled and then failed at run time, because an
!!! implementation's symbol was keyed on the EXTENDING book while the call
!!! site mangled it from the receiver's inferred type -- the type's own book:
!!!
!!!     declared  oculus__window__geometry__util__rectangle__area
!!!     called    oculus__window__geometry__rectangle__area
book tour.shape

!!! A class, extended the same way. A class declaration knows only the
!!! members written inside it, so the member lookup has to consult the
!!! extension table before concluding a member does not exist -- it used to
!!! return early and report "has no member", in its own book as well.
public surface begin class
    field label as text
    field scale as number
end class

public rectangle begin record
    field width  as number
    field height as number
end record
